 <p class="eyebrow">Glossary</p>
 <h1 style="margin-top:var(--sp-4)">Terms worth knowing before you brief a vendor.</h1>
 <p class="lead">
 Rental software and SEO both hide behind jargon. These are the terms that actually change what
 you get, defined without the sales language.
 </p>
